Notebook[{
Cell["ECGrav", "GuideTitle",
 CellID->323818939,ExpressionUUID->"f4f6bdba-0a7a-453b-ac3e-2b0b6242ce29"],

Cell["\<\
ECGrav (Emergent Combinatorial Gravity) is a Wolfram Language paclet for \
building and analyzing pure simplicial complexes and for running Monte Carlo \
simulations of graph and complex models. It provides combinatorial-topology \
tools, uniform and Markov-chain random-complex generators, a family of graph \
Hamiltonians, and Metropolis, parallel-tempering, and multiple-histogram \
simulation drivers together with thermodynamic-analysis functions.\
\>", "GuideAbstract",
 CellID->932045640,ExpressionUUID->"dcf3a5e7-5472-454d-96f2-39c3955e501d"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

